{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-53","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"To find the sixth binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":53,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":53,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","contentId":"euclid-10-53","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c4b1d32518873a6b0e42e5366cfde52a7dc38bc60cd47a9991802f46e5c8bc8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-53.statement","euclid-10-53.construction.1","euclid-10-53.construction.2","euclid-10-53.proof.1","euclid-10-53.proof.2","euclid-10-53.proof.3","euclid-10-53.proof.4","euclid-10-53.proof.5","euclid-10-53.proof.6","euclid-10-53.proof.7","euclid-10-53.proof.8","euclid-10-53.proof.9","euclid-10-53.proof.10","euclid-10-53.proof.11","euclid-10-53.proof.12","euclid-10-53.construction.3","euclid-10-53.proof.13","euclid-10-53.proof.14","euclid-10-53.proof.15","euclid-10-53.proof.16","euclid-10-53.proof.17","euclid-10-53.construction.4","euclid-10-53.proof.18","euclid-10-53.proof.19","euclid-10-53.proof.20","euclid-10-53.proof.21","euclid-10-53.proof.22","euclid-10-53.proof.23","euclid-10-53.proof.24","euclid-10-53.proof.25","euclid-10-53.proof.26","euclid-10-53.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-53.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24f7d7c66c23ffd423211aaccdb05561c5fd01d193fb57ecc212065ec1333d5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the sixth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找第六条二项无理线段直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aeb8fc6837af3d2f64bd2258855f72f716b5167f24a6d0cf08bbada308b06706","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers AC, CB be set out such that AB has not to either of them the ratio which a square number has to a square number; and let there also be another number D which is not square and which has not to either of the numbers BA, AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个数字AC,CB,AB与其中任何一个没有平方数与平方数之间的比;再列出一个数字D,而不是正方形,而其中任何一个数字BA,AC与平方数的比例没有关系。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6291cbb283ada5fa506e5b003af97598b42b38086d2479dbf6c12b3e12d8b168","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any rational straight line E be set out, and let it be contrived that, as D is to AB, so is the square on E to the square on FG; [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on E is commensurable with the square on FG. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何有理线段 E数字都行,并假设D和AB数字之比等于E和FG的正方形个数字之比;因此,E和正方形个数字为可公度个和FG数字为正方形个数字 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4262e618ae984e2db7402e5dd5b7e6c97db73a8e2e235c4bc92706ea070be3e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And E is rational; therefore FG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E是有理,FG也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"426970543c4ef92c3ed2aad71c0f5da6abf259e68a85b766b710d5594c5f6b86","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since D has not to AB the ratio which a square number has to a square number, neither has the square on E to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore E is incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于D的比例尚未达到AB的比例,平方数的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例,E的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例,FG的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例；上述对应量不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1e4c0ec1933f376f17725ec689782578c6a649bfee18ff7e67b9505db4a43da","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let it be contrived that, as BA is to AC, so is the square on FG to the square on GH. [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们想,BA比AC的比例等于FG比正方形比GH [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73afd3e288e0629851c9a85e29e1b7ec707574b816ce378673f63fbf3a3a5293","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on FG is commensurable with the square on HG. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG正方形是可公度,HG是正方形。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7029380faccbd0ea9d60972b6c67a08ef32c033616d001dd6481a82890553ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on HG is rational; therefore HG is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,HG的正方形是有理;HG是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf429eba3fc7068613815a352aa0605c929259d5f4faeb4a19078d9c5e768f08","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BA has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, neither has the square on FG to the square on GH the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore FG is incommensurable in length with GH. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BA的比例没有达到AC的比例,平方数的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例,FG的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例,GH的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例；上述对应量不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ff1753ab59a419a5fb159ceae034c12bd5a5d273743b326bd8a53a952f8e3a9","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG, GH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore FH is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG,GH是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;FH是二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f60dc551ef49cf5d5a3249c5862ab87e304e8ad664a9f4fe994e333abd49f1c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next to be proved that it is also a sixth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步是证明它也是第六条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99363087d5bbd048ec0f8bb4e705c93a4126ce348412ecaeff8c792a9758b822","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as D is to AB, so is the square on E to the square on FG, and also, as BA is to AC, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore, ex aequali, as D is to AC, so is the square on E to the square on GH. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D比AB,这等于E比正方形,FG比正方形,AC比正方形,BA比GH比正方形,GH比正方形,因此,在平等的基础上,D比AC等于E比正方形比正方形 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88d04e93d6ab020ee524af531b56d38e6fd73191a076a21d1a9eadd731487c57","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on E to the square on GH the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore E is incommensurable in length with GH. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,GH的比例为正方形,而E的比例为正方形,而GH的比例为平方数;因此,E的比例为不可公度,而GH的比例为不可公度。（相关点与线段：AC） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6eb2a2f1c4266d8a7b2894c895e4c290a368fff8097eb149bf7558a26f18d44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved incommensurable with FG; therefore each of the straight lines FG, GH is incommensurable in length with E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据证明,有不可公度,FG,GH直线各有不可公度,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0cc13cc6bba8fb7ab6f8c1217efd1cbe279c1db41c95798084a9fb29f55318f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, as BA is to AC, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore the square on FG is greater than the square on GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA比AC等于FG比正方形,GH比正方形,因此FG比正方形大于GH"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":15,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"789fa33c76f943843ad8f8ea0a3429f16b93eacf6fe781b5bf46347e9a37034c","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then the squares on GH, K be equal to the square on FG; therefore, convertendo, as AB is to BC, so is the square on FG to the square on K. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GH,K,正方形等于FG,正方形;因此,转换率为AB-BC,相当于FG,正方形与K,正方形；上述对应量具有相同的比例关系。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e893def5271c0059699a3e11558dbcbcf0bbb956353032b910fed38a9c049321","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB has not to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; so that neither has the square on FG to the square on K the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB比平方数比平方数比平方数比平方数,FG比正方形比K比平方数比平方数。（相关点与线段：BC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e68dfba18caa70748adba105c29cb768e8b3cf88d74b76f952d5996e84cb098","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG is incommensurable in length with K; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] therefore the square on FG is greater than the square on GH by the square on a straight line incommensurable with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG的长度为不可公度,K的长度为FG,因此,FG的长度比GH的正方形长,比不可公度的直线不可公度和FG的正方形大。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6e04b9a3a85a4d262baa5fc2c1b6aeeb6df590c293b5cec268dc0dea7a532d8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FG, GH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and neither of them is commensurable in length with the rational straight line E set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG,GH是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度, 两者中无一是长度可公度,有理线段 E是。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c4410ad10417f5aff2886ffe72785f19b6e74dcad7c2b68cbd9b6333236dfbc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FH is a sixth binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FH是第六条二项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd12f78653b7e219dddd3d3524671d91e9bea4686ce6dbc1334168d2d83f2a44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. Let there be two squares AB, BC, and let them be placed so that DB is in a straight line with BE; therefore FB is also in a straight line with BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"莱姆马。 让它们坐上两张正方形 AB,BC, 让它们坐好, 这样DB直线, BE直线, 因此FB直线, BG直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":21,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"174f16ad7d846fb94061811f193b36c8bd3591a46bcfcd3a206ac4c71b2e820a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the parallelogram AC be completed; I say that AC is a square, that DG is a mean proportional between AB, BC, and further that DC is a mean proportional between AC, CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们完成平行四边形 AC工程;我说,AC工程是正方形工程,DG工程是AB工程,BC工程是比例中项工程,DC工程是AC工程,CB工程是比例中项工程。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efc8c7e22c90462c69a9a5212d8a2cff6d6d72c7335b782b14ded0123e21ab94","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since DB is equal to BF, and BE to BG, therefore the whole DE is equal to the whole FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为DB等于BF,BE至BG,因此,整个DE等于整个FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84d5938a5f5c90d849c0382b153e8d6f56e7e53616394e6a40b455ecc35c539a","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DE is equal to each of the straight lines AH, KC, and FG is equal to each of the straight lines AK, HC; [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] therefore each of the straight lines AH, KC is also equal to each of the straight lines AK, HC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DE直线等于AH,KC,FG直线等于AK,HC直线等于每一条;因此,AH直线等于KC直线等于每一条直线,AK等于HC直线。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b14acd7f189e1dbaf3833c8e548525ee93cc1c5281400e18688eaadcc96a64ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the parallelogram AC is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,平行四边形 AC是等边的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00d0d242726aad7ca59a5316e8d538e97d4fc8b058f2cef4be6fe6a00adf7a4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is also rectangular; therefore AC is a square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也是长方形的,因此AC是正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"025a9d3f43455a3bb1ad28965b6c286c265a9a00d3ba81f1f7926ac753ae6a96","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as FB is to BG, so is DB to BE, while, as FB is to BG, so is AB to DG, and, as DB is to BE, so is DG to BC, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore also, as AB is to DG, so is DG to BC. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FB对BG的比等于DB对BE的比,FB对BG的比等于AB对DG的比,DB对BE的比等于DG对BC的比,因此,AB对DG对BC的比也等于DG对BC的比；FB 与 BG 之比等于 DB 与 BE 之比；FB 与 BG 之比等于 AB 与 DG 之比；DB 与 BE 之比等于 DG 与 BC 之比；AB 与 DG 之比等于 DG 与 BC 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9abf6f78ecba844dc0d719305e7c4f6a8e93e3114df014d6bb7cf679f869516","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DG is a mean proportional between AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DG是AB,BC之间的比例中项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"da4048cf5674e47ce507cfdb4edd1f5add9cba3300facb473b2c7bd6d06097c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that DC is also a mean proportional between AC, CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,DC也是AC,CB之间的比例中项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e3e0a79420680853852aa2acdc9ff7a00d4864696d73b66c104bd925df0a766","citations":["euclid-5-18","euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as AD is to DK, so is KG to GC— for they are equal respectively— and, componendo, as AK is to KD, so is KC to CG, [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)] while, as AK is to KD, so is AC to CD, and, as KC is to CG, so is DC to CB, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore also, as AC is to DC, so is DC to BC. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD-DK的比相当于KG-GC的比,因为两者是平等的,AK-KD的比等于KC-CG的比,而AK-KD的比等于AC-CD的比,KC-CG的比等于DC-CB的比,因此,AC-DC的比等于DC-BC的比；AD 与 DK 之比等于 KG 与 GC 之比；AK 与 KD 之比等于 KC 与 CG 之比；AK 与 KD 之比等于 AC 与 CD 之比；KC 与 CG 之比等于 DC 与 CB 之比；AC 与 DC 之比等于 DC 与 BC 之比。 [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)] [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1fe5527a3cd39d9e0d430d6bc2b31119df8179044114dce2c26e35c0291fde5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DC is a mean proportional between AC, CB. Being what it was proposed to prove."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DC是AC,CB之间的比例中项,这是拟议证明。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-53.source","contentId":"euclid-10-53","revisionId":"euclid-10-53@raw-1c4b1d32518873a6","order":31,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ef7b65fd9cea6fb2a70a5489b87728eae837664c440940c6e7930dd056c5201","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-53:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-53","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-53.construction.2","euclid-10-53.proof.3","euclid-10-53.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/","sourceLabel":"X. 6, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-53:euclid-10-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-53","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-53.proof.2","euclid-10-53.proof.6","euclid-10-53.proof.10","euclid-10-53.proof.14"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/","sourceLabel":"X. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-53:euclid-10-36:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-53","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-53.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-36","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/","sourceLabel":"X. 36"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-53:euclid-5-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-53","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-53.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/","sourceLabel":"V. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-53:euclid-5-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-53","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-53.construction.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/","sourceLabel":"V. 19, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-53:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-53","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-53.proof.19"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53/","sourceLabel":"I. 34"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-53:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-53","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-53.proof.22","euclid-10-53.proof.25"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.53